# Torch stack: torch 2.14.0 on the cu132 index, as the GB10-proven TripoSG and Step1X images that
# build sm_121 extensions on the CUDA 13.4.1 devel base. The creator's torch 2.5.1 / cu124 stack has
# no GB10 (aarch64, CUDA 13) build, so this is a platform fact, not a creator choice.
torch==2.14.0
torchvision==0.29.0

